  "solution": {
    "text": "As the period of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br />So,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>50</mn></mrow></mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math><br />Applying <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> property and adding, we get,<br /><math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br />(As <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></math> )<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8747;</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>&#960;</mi></math>",
